# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[immobilize]] with [[force]].
# {{context|slang|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[kill]] or [[destroy]].
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To obtain by application by a legal or other official process.
